# UnsignedInteger8 power within range

Verifies uint8 exponentiation with base and exponent chosen to stay inside
the 8-bit range through the complete CLI pipeline. The exponent is uint8 as
well: the type has no mixed-type operations.

>>> source
const base: uint8 = 2
const exponent: uint8 = 7

const power: uint8 = base ** exponent
print(power)

<<< stdout
128

<<< stderr
